Package: sscep
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Simple Certificate Enrollment Protocol client
 sscep is a command line client for the SCEP protocol (RFC 8894).
 It can request, renew and fetch certificates and CRLs from a SCEP
 server. PacketFence uses it to test SCEP enrollment.
